    "collapsible_content_vr": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "faq_1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Will my girlfriend notice?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>In the best way. Most men tell us the first thing a partner notices is that they smell <strong>clean and fresh</strong> — not heavily fragranced. It reads as natural, just better.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_2": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What does the cooling feel like?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>Fresh, not freezing.</strong> A light menthol cool that signals “clean” and settles into all day comfort. Refreshing in summer, never harsh.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is it safe for sensitive skin?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>It’s built for it. pH matched to <strong>5.5</strong>, free from sulphates, parabens and silicones, and loaded with soothing actives like aloe and ceramides. Gentle enough for daily use.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_4": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why not just use my regular body wash?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Regular soap runs at pH 9 to 11 and is built to scrub, not to care for intimate skin at pH 5.5. Over time it strips the barrier — which is what brings back dryness, itch and odor. <strong>CoolBro cleans without the collateral damage.</strong></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_5": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Does it actually help with odor?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes — at the source. <strong>Zinc ricinoleate</strong> neutralises odor molecules instead of masking them, so freshness lasts well beyond the shower.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_6": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What makes CoolBro different?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>It’s made specifically for below the belt: skin matched pH, real odor control, a soothing complex and a cooling finish — in one daily step. Not a cheeky three in one with a new label.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_7": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I use it every day?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>That’s the idea. The gentle, skin matched formula is <strong>designed for daily use</strong> — the more consistent you are, the better skin stays balanced and fresh.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_8": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How fast will I notice a difference?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>The cool, clean feeling is <strong>immediate</strong>. All day odor control and calmer skin build over the first <strong>1 to 2 weeks</strong> as it replaces the harsh soap working against you.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
